<blockquote>Book of Soil<br /> Translated from lshgiruan by Fasium, a survivor.</blockquote>

<blockquote>In Wellah, the Empress counts each clod of soil from east to west, the hot orb upon her back. There are four creatures at the command of her sword. The Crane, who flies in the night. The shimmering Snake, who can bite. The Dragon-Dog, who may fight. And most precious, the Mouse who gives her sight. </blockquote>

